% Generate pdd/frontend/components/CloudDashboard.tsx as a strict React TypeScript component.

Export named function CloudDashboard. Call service endpoints on the page's own origin.
Require a password token input before any API call. Keep the token only in component memory.
Fetch sessions and examples immediately and every 30 seconds after connection.
Preserve a selected session while present; select an active replacement when it disappears.
Support /connect/{session_id} as the initial selection.
Submit command type and JSON-object args/options through submitCommand with a fresh Idempotency-Key.
Default options to {local: true}. Treat args.args as ordered positional CLI arguments.
Reject arrays, null, and primitives in either JSON field.
Poll command results every 1.5 seconds until completed, failed, or cancelled.
Offer cancellation while pending/processing and display returned stdout/stderr/result as text.
Enable Run only for an active selected session. Clear token, selection, results, and errors on disconnect.
Show owner-visible examples and useful HTTP errors. Stop timers and ignore stale responses after cleanup.
Use native accessible form controls and bundled Tailwind surface colors.

